      "message": "Merge upstream/main into issue/1810-cavity-outline-size-law\n\nKeep both sides: UndercutLift with AvoidHit and FirstTraverseLow;\nSlotUndercut refusal with corner relief; the undercut plan with\ncorner relief zones. Port the undercut tool kinds, seed and dovetail\nrow onto the #2397 settings grid.\n\nRefs #1810\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
