    "sha": "14b092568cd4d518086c4d909451b48fd962e940",
    "node_id": "C_kwDOVoU8JdoAKDE0YjA5MjU2OGNkNGQ1MTgwODZjNGQ5MDk0NTFiNDhmZDk2MmU5NDA",
    "commit": {
      "author": {
        "name": "Mike Kinney",
        "email": "mike.kinney@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-11-21T09:52:42Z"
      },
      "committer": {
        "name": "Mike Kinney",
        "email": "mike.kinney@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-11-21T09:52:42Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(sim): grow the undercut heads in the keep-out check\n\nThe merge of main brought the \"Do not touch\" check (#2055). Its\nswept atoms did not know this branch's Atom::cap field and the\ndovetail and lollipop heads, so camcraft-sim did not build.\n\n- avoid_poly: the swept atom keeps the source atom's prof and cap.\n- rho_expanded: a dovetail grows as its r cylinder; a lollipop grows\n  as the capsule of its ball over the atom's Z stretch (the cylinder\n  when the atom is shorter than the ball). Each is an upper bound for\n  any vertical stretch, so the check can warn early but never miss.\n\nPinned by verify::swept::tests (brute-force Minkowski check).\n\nRefs #1810\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
