      "message": "test: follow main's playback and shape-window laws in undercut pins\n\n- stock_play: #2901 makes a zero-length opening rapid done at t = 0,\n  so the undercut playback reads move 1 there, as the face test does.\n- tool_undercut: the shape window shows the cutter parameters on the\n  Profile tab's drawn cutter; open it before reading the flank angle.\n\nRefs #1810\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
