        "date": "2026-11-21T23:39:25Z"
      },
      "message": "Merge upstream/main into issue/1810-cavity-outline-size-law\n\nConflicts:\n- verify/avoid_poly.rs: keep main's cap: false for a protected item.\n- stock_play.rs, tool_undercut.rs, tool_settings_grid.rs: comment\n  text only; take main's.\n\nSemantic clash (no marker): main's rho_expanded reads Dove and Ball as\nthe circumscribed cylinder in a combined arm, which made this branch's\ndovetail-cylinder and lollipop-capsule arms unreachable. Keep main's\narm, drop the dead arms and the cylinder helper. The lollipop pin keeps\nits never-below-the-solid check and drops the capsule tightness assert.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
